<title>USA: Gap Inc Aug. same-store sales unchanged.</title>
<headline>Gap Inc Aug. same-store sales unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		 $441	 $370	 +19	 unch</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $2,674     $2,114	 +26	   +8</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>Month is 4 weeks ended August 31.</p>
<p>As of Aug. 31, Gap operated 1,779 stores versus 1,602 at about the same time one year ago, an increase of 11 pct.</p>
</text>
